## PHẦN X: ANTIGRAVITY-STYLE REQUEST INFERENCE

### X.1 Tổng quan

> **Concept:** Khi nhận yêu cầu, phải suy luận **đúng mục đích** trước khi implement. Giống như Antigravity AI - phân tích sâu intent để đưa ra đúng solution, không chỉ làm theo yêu cầu literal.

**Flow:**
```
USER REQUEST
     │
     ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ 1. SURFACE ANALYSIS                     │
│    • Extract keywords                    │
│    • Detect language                     │
│    • Translate if needed                │
└─────────────────────────────────────────┘
     │
     ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ 2. INTENT DECONSTRUCTION                │
│    • What user SAID                    │
│    • What user MEANT                    │
│    • What user REALLY needs             │
└─────────────────────────────────────────┘
     │
     ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ 3. GOAL EXTRACTION                     │
│    • Explicit goals                     │
│    • Implicit goals                     │
│    • Success criteria                   │
└─────────────────────────────────────────┘
     │
     ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ 4. SOLUTION SYNTHESIS                   │
│    • Optimal solution                   │
│    • Trade-offs                        │
│    • Alternatives                       │
└─────────────────────────────────────────┘
     │
     ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ OUTPUT: TASK MANIFEST                   │
│    • Skills (with token budget)        │
│    • Tasks (atomic, 2-5min)           │
│    • Context (minimal sufficient)      │
└─────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

### X.2 Request Pattern Analysis

#### X.2.1 Vietnamese Intent Detection

```yaml
vi_intent_patterns:

  BUILD:
    patterns:
      - "tạo" / "tạo ra" / "xây dựng" / "phát triển"
      - "thêm" / "bổ sung" / "implement"
      - "cài đặt" / "thiết lập" / "setup"
    implicit_needs:
      - "tạo landing page" → may need: value proposition clarity
      - "tạo API" → may need: error handling, auth
      - "tạo database" → may need: indexing, migrations

  FIX:
    patterns:
      - "sửa" / "sửa lỗi" / "fix" / "debug"
      - "khắc phục" / "giải quyết"
    implicit_needs:
      - "sửa bug" → may need: root cause analysis
      - "fix lỗi" → may need: test coverage
      - "debug api" → may need: logging, monitoring

  REDESIGN:
    patterns:
      - "cải thiện" / "nâng cấp" / "improve"
      - "tái thiết kế" / "redesign" / "rebuild"
      - "hiện đại hóa" / "modernize"
    implicit_needs:
      - "cải thiện UI" → may need: user feedback
      - "nâng cấp" → may need: migration plan
```

#### X.2.2 Implicit Need Detection

```
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
[IMPLICIT NEED DETECTION]

Request: "Tạo một landing page cho startup AI của tôi"

EXPLICIT (what user said):
  • Create landing page
  • For AI startup

IMPLICIT (what user may actually need):
  1. Convert visitors → leads (what's the CTA?)
  2. Communicate value → what's unique about this AI?
  3. Build trust → social proof, testimonials
  4. Differentiate → why this AI vs competitors?

GOALS:
  • Landing page exists ✓
  • Page converts visitors ✓
  • Communicates value clearly ✓
  • Has clear CTA ✓

SUCCESS CRITERIA:
  • Page loads < 2s
  • CTA visible above fold
  • Form submission works
  • Mobile responsive
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
```

### X.3 Alternative Proposal Triggers

**Đề xuất giải pháp thay thế khi:**

1. User request over-engineering
2. Có pre-built solution tốt hơn
3. User chưa hiểu vấn đề đủ

```
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
[ALTERNATIVE PROPOSAL]

Your request: "Build custom authentication from scratch"

Analysis:
• What you asked: Custom auth system
• What you likely need: Secure user authentication
• Alternative: Use existing auth solution

RECOMMENDED APPROACHES:

A) Use existing auth (Auth0, Clerk, NextAuth)
   ├── Pros: Secure, fast, free tier
   ├── Cons: Vendor lock-in (manageable)
   └── Best for: Most SaaS apps

B) Build custom (if specific requirements)
   ├── Pros: Full control
   ├── Cons: 2-3 weeks, security risk
   └── Best for: Unique compliance needs

I recommend: A) Use existing auth
Rationale: Save time, security vetted

Do you want to:
[A] Use existing auth (recommended)
[B] Build custom (specify unique requirements)
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
```

